"Mesa de Torsion FEA — DKE Wilson (Discrete Kirchhoff Element)
#rad
'<hr/>
'<h3>Portico 3D: 4 col C40x40 + 4 vigas V30x50 + losa Shell-Thin 10cm</h3>
'<p>Formulacion: <b>DKE Batoz-Tahar 1982 = Wilson Ch8 DKE</b> (Kirchhoff, sin cortante transversal)</p>
'<p>Carga: Live = 0.5 tonf/m2 &nbsp; | &nbsp; Mesh 5x5 = 25 elem, 36 nodos piso</p>
'<p>Ref: Ibrahimbegovic &amp; Wilson (1991), CSI Analysis Reference Manual Ch.X</p>
'<hr/>
'<h3>FORMULACION SIMBOLICA (derivacion de las ecuaciones)</h3>
#noc
'<h4>Funciones de forma Q8 Serendipity (elemento DKE)</h4>
'<p>El DKE usa funciones Q8 Serendipity en coordenadas naturales (ξ, η):</p>
'<p>N<sub>1</sub>(ξ,η) = (1−ξ)(1−η)(−ξ−η−1)/4</p>
'<p>N<sub>2</sub>(ξ,η) = (1+ξ)(1−η)(ξ−η−1)/4</p>
'<p>N<sub>5</sub>(ξ,η) = (1−ξ²)(1−η)/2</p>
'<h4>Derivadas parciales de las funciones de forma</h4>
'<p>∂N/∂ξ y ∂N/∂η necesarias para la matriz B:</p>
'<p>∂N<sub>1</sub>/∂ξ &nbsp;(diferenciando N<sub>1</sub> respecto de ξ)</p>
'<p>∂N<sub>1</sub>/∂η</p>
'<h4>Jacobiano del elemento</h4>
'<p>J_e transforma del espacio natural (ξ,η) al espacio fisico (x,y):</p>
'<p>J<sub>e</sub> = [ ∂x/∂ξ , ∂y/∂ξ ; ∂x/∂η , ∂y/∂η ]</p>
'<h4>Matriz de rigidez flexural D</h4>
'<p>Relacion constitutiva placa Kirchhoff:</p>
D_flex = E*t^3/(12*(1 - ν^2))*[1; ν; 0|ν; 1; 0|0; 0; (1 - ν)/2]
'<h4>Rigidez elemental K (integral doble)</h4>
'<p>K_ij se obtiene integrando B&rsquo;&middot;D&middot;B sobre el elemento:</p>
'<p>K<sub>ij</sub> = ∫∫ B<sub>i</sub><sup>T</sup>·D·B<sub>j</sub>·det(J<sub>e</sub>) dξ dη &nbsp; (ξ,η ∈ [−1,1])</p>
'<h4>Vector de fuerzas nodales (carga distribuida)</h4>
'<p>F<sub>i</sub> = ∫∫ N<sub>i</sub>·q·det(J<sub>e</sub>) dξ dη</p>
'<h4>Viga Euler-Bernoulli 3D — rigidez elemental</h4>
'<p>DOFs por nodo: [u, v, w, θx, θy, θz]. Terminos principales:</p>
K_axial = E*A/L*[1; -1|-1; 1]
K_torsion = G*J/L*[1; -1|-1; 1]
K_flexion = E*I/L^3*[12; 6*L; -12; 6*L|6*L; 4*L^2; -6*L; 2*L^2|-12; -6*L; 12; -6*L|6*L; 2*L^2; -6*L; 4*L^2]
'<hr/>
#equ
'<h3>PARTE I — Datos de entrada</h3>
'<h4>1.1 Geometria (del e2k ETABS)</h4>
a = 6
b = 6
H_p = 4
'<h4>1.2 Secciones</h4>
b_c = 0.40
h_c = 0.40
b_v = 0.30
h_v = 0.50
t_l = 0.10
'<h4>1.3 Material — Concreto 4000Psi (e2k: E=2534564 tonf/m2, nu=0.2)</h4>
E_c = 2534564*9.80665
nu_c = 0.20
G_c = E_c/(2*(1 + nu_c))
g = 9.80665
'<h4>1.4 Malla</h4>
n_m = 5
d_x = a/n_m
d_y = b/n_m
n_base = 4
n_floor = (n_m + 1)^2
n_j = n_base + n_floor
n_dof = 6*n_j
#val
'Nodos ='n_j', GDL ='n_dof', Elementos shell ='n_m^2', Frames ='4 + 4*n_m
#equ
'<h4>1.5 Propiedades de seccion</h4>
#hide
A_c = b_c*h_c
I_yc = b_c*h_c^3/12
I_zc = h_c*b_c^3/12
r_c = min(b_c; h_c)/max(b_c; h_c)
beta_c = (1/3)*(1 - 0.21*r_c*(1 - r_c^4/12))
J_c = beta_c*max(b_c; h_c)*min(b_c; h_c)^3
A_v = b_v*h_v
I_yv = b_v*h_v^3/12
I_zv = h_v*b_v^3/12
r_v = min(b_v; h_v)/max(b_v; h_v)
beta_v = (1/3)*(1 - 0.21*r_v*(1 - r_v^4/12))
J_v = beta_v*max(b_v; h_v)*min(b_v; h_v)^3
#show
'Columna C40x40:
A_c
I_yc
J_c
'Viga V30x50:
A_v
I_yv
J_v
'<hr/>
'<h3>PARTE II — Matriz K_DKE bending 12x12 (Batoz DKQ)</h3>
'<p>Elemento Discrete Kirchhoff Quadrilateral — DOFs: [w, bx, by] x 4 nodos</p>
'<p>bx = dw/dx (pendiente en x), by = dw/dy (pendiente en y)</p>
'<p>Cuadratura: 2x2 Gauss | Kirchhoff discreto en mid-sides Q8 Serendipity</p>
'<h4>2.1 Rigidez flexural</h4>
D_f = E_c*t_l^3/(12*(1 - nu_c^2))
D_mat = D_f*[1; nu_c; 0|nu_c; 1; 0|0; 0; (1 - nu_c)/2]
'<h4>2.2 Parametros DKE</h4>
a_h = d_x/2
b_h = d_y/2
c_a = 1.5/d_x
c_b = 1.5/d_y
gp = [-1/sqrt(3); 1/sqrt(3)]
gw = [1; 1]
'<h4>2.3 Funciones Q8 Serendipity (shape functions y derivadas)</h4>
N1q(x; y) = (1 - x)*(1 - y)*(-x - y - 1)/4
N2q(x; y) = (1 + x)*(1 - y)*( x - y - 1)/4
N3q(x; y) = (1 + x)*(1 + y)*( x + y - 1)/4
N4q(x; y) = (1 - x)*(1 + y)*(-x + y - 1)/4
N5q(x; y) = (1 - x^2)*(1 - y)/2
N6q(x; y) = (1 + x)*(1 - y^2)/2
N7q(x; y) = (1 - x^2)*(1 + y)/2
N8q(x; y) = (1 - x)*(1 - y^2)/2
dN1q_dx(x; y) = (1 - y)*(2*x + y)/4
dN2q_dx(x; y) = (1 - y)*(2*x - y)/4
dN3q_dx(x; y) = (1 + y)*(2*x + y)/4
dN4q_dx(x; y) = (1 + y)*(2*x - y)/4
dN5q_dx(x; y) = -x*(1 - y)
dN6q_dx(x; y) = (1 - y^2)/2
dN7q_dx(x; y) = -x*(1 + y)
dN8q_dx(x; y) = -(1 - y^2)/2
dN1q_dy(x; y) = (1 - x)*(x + 2*y)/4
dN2q_dy(x; y) = (1 + x)*(-x + 2*y)/4
dN3q_dy(x; y) = (1 + x)*(x + 2*y)/4
dN4q_dy(x; y) = (1 - x)*(-x + 2*y)/4
dN5q_dy(x; y) = -(1 - x^2)/2
dN6q_dy(x; y) = -y*(1 + x)
dN7q_dy(x; y) = (1 - x^2)/2
dN8q_dy(x; y) = -y*(1 - x)
'<h4>2.4 Substitucion Kirchhoff discreto (Wilson Eq. 8.21)</h4>
'<p>bx<sub>mid</sub> = c_a*(w<sub>j</sub> - w<sub>i</sub>) - 0.25*(bx<sub>i</sub> + bx<sub>j</sub>)</p>
dHxdxi(j; x; y) = take(j; -c_a*dN5q_dx(x; y); dN1q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN5q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN8q_dx(x; y); 0; c_a*dN5q_dx(x; y); dN2q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN5q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN6q_dx(x; y); 0; c_a*dN7q_dx(x; y); dN3q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN6q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN7q_dx(x; y); 0; -c_a*dN7q_dx(x; y); dN4q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN7q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN8q_dx(x; y); 0)
dHxdeta(j; x; y) = take(j; -c_a*dN5q_dy(x; y); dN1q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN5q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN8q_dy(x; y); 0; c_a*dN5q_dy(x; y); dN2q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN5q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN6q_dy(x; y); 0; c_a*dN7q_dy(x; y); dN3q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN6q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN7q_dy(x; y); 0; -c_a*dN7q_dy(x; y); dN4q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN7q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN8q_dy(x; y); 0)
dHydxi(j; x; y) = take(j; -c_b*dN8q_dx(x; y); 0; dN1q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN5q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN8q_dx(x; y); -c_b*dN6q_dx(x; y); 0; dN2q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN5q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN6q_dx(x; y); c_b*dN6q_dx(x; y); 0; dN3q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN6q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN7q_dx(x; y); c_b*dN8q_dx(x; y); 0; dN4q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN7q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN8q_dx(x; y))
dHydeta(j; x; y) = take(j; -c_b*dN8q_dy(x; y); 0; dN1q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN5q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN8q_dy(x; y); -c_b*dN6q_dy(x; y); 0; dN2q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN5q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN6q_dy(x; y); c_b*dN6q_dy(x; y); 0; dN3q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN6q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN7q_dy(x; y); c_b*dN8q_dy(x; y); 0; dN4q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN7q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN8q_dy(x; y))
'<h4>2.5 Matriz B y K_DKE</h4>
#hide
BTDB(i; j; x; y) = transp([dHxdxi(i; x; y)/a_h; dHydeta(i; x; y)/b_h; dHxdeta(i; x; y)/b_h + dHydxi(i; x; y)/a_h])*D_mat*[dHxdxi(j; x; y)/a_h; dHydeta(j; x; y)/b_h; dHxdeta(j; x; y)/b_h + dHydxi(j; x; y)/a_h]
K_e_ij(i; j) = a_h*b_h*(gw.1*gw.1*BTDB(i; j; gp.1; gp.1) + gw.2*gw.1*BTDB(i; j; gp.2; gp.1) + gw.1*gw.2*BTDB(i; j; gp.1; gp.2) + gw.2*gw.2*BTDB(i; j; gp.2; gp.2))
K_DKE = utriang(12)
$Repeat{$Repeat{K_DKE.(i; j) = K_e_ij(i; j) @ j = i : 12} @ i = 1 : 12}
#show
'K_DKE (12x12, triangular superior):
K_DKE
'<hr/>
'<h3>PARTE III — Shell 24x24: DKE + membrana + drilling</h3>
'<h4>3.1 Membrana Q4 bilineal (8x8)</h4>
#hide
Em_f = E_c*t_l/(1 - nu_c^2)
K_mem = matrix(8; 8)
gp_m1 = -1/sqrt(3)
gp_m2 = 1/sqrt(3)
#for igx = 1 : 2
	#for igy = 1 : 2
		#if igx ≡ 1
			xi_g = gp_m1
		#else
			xi_g = gp_m2
		#end if
		#if igy ≡ 1
			eta_g = gp_m1
		#else
			eta_g = gp_m2
		#end if
		B_m = matrix(3; 8)
		dN_1x = -0.25*(1 - eta_g)/a_h
		dN_2x = 0.25*(1 - eta_g)/a_h
		dN_3x = 0.25*(1 + eta_g)/a_h
		dN_4x = -0.25*(1 + eta_g)/a_h
		dN_1y = -0.25*(1 - xi_g)/b_h
		dN_2y = -0.25*(1 + xi_g)/b_h
		dN_3y = 0.25*(1 + xi_g)/b_h
		dN_4y = 0.25*(1 - xi_g)/b_h
		B_m.(1; 1) = dN_1x','B_m.(1; 3) = dN_2x','B_m.(1; 5) = dN_3x','B_m.(1; 7) = dN_4x
		B_m.(2; 2) = dN_1y','B_m.(2; 4) = dN_2y','B_m.(2; 6) = dN_3y','B_m.(2; 8) = dN_4y
		B_m.(3; 1) = dN_1y','B_m.(3; 2) = dN_1x
		B_m.(3; 3) = dN_2y','B_m.(3; 4) = dN_2x
		B_m.(3; 5) = dN_3y','B_m.(3; 6) = dN_3x
		B_m.(3; 7) = dN_4y','B_m.(3; 8) = dN_4x
		Em_B = matrix(3; 8)
		#for cc = 1 : 8
			Em_B.(1; cc) = Em_f*(B_m.(1; cc) + nu_c*B_m.(2; cc))
			Em_B.(2; cc) = Em_f*(nu_c*B_m.(1; cc) + B_m.(2; cc))
			Em_B.(3; cc) = Em_f*(1 - nu_c)/2*B_m.(3; cc)
		#loop
		K_mem = K_mem + transp(B_m)*Em_B*(a_h*b_h)
	#loop
#loop
#show
'<h4>3.2 Mapeo DKE → Shell (CORRECCION bx/by)</h4>
'<p><b>Clave:</b> bx = dw/dx = -ry, by = dw/dy = rx (Batoz vs ingenieria)</p>
'<p>Transformacion: T = [1,0,0 | 0,0,1 | 0,-1,0]</p>
T_bend = [1; 0; 0|0; 0; 1|0; -1; 0]
T_bend
'<h4>3.3 Ensamblar Shell 24x24</h4>
#hide
K_shell = matrix(24; 24)
#for ni = 1 : 4
	#for nj = 1 : 4
		#for di = 1 : 2
			#for dj = 1 : 2
				K_shell.((ni-1)*6+di; (nj-1)*6+dj) = K_mem.((ni-1)*2+di; (nj-1)*2+dj)
			#loop
		#loop
	#loop
#loop
#for ni = 1 : 4
	#for nj = 1 : 4
		K_DKE_block = submatrix(K_DKE; (ni-1)*3+1; ni*3; (nj-1)*3+1; nj*3)
		K_DKE_t = transp(T_bend)*K_DKE_block*T_bend
		#for di = 1 : 3
			#for dj = 1 : 3
				K_shell.((ni-1)*6+2+di; (nj-1)*6+2+dj) = K_DKE_t.(di; dj)
			#loop
		#loop
	#loop
#loop
drill = 0
#for ii = 1 : 8
	drill = drill + abs(K_mem.(ii; ii))
#loop
drill = drill*10^-6/8
#for ni = 1 : 4
	K_shell.((ni-1)*6+6; (ni-1)*6+6) = drill
#loop
#show
'<hr/>
'<h3>PARTE IV — Vigas y columnas (Euler-Bernoulli 3D)</h3>
'<h4>4.1 K columna 12x12 (local → global)</h4>
#hide

K_beam = matrix(12; 12)
L_el = H_p
A_el = A_c','Iy_el = I_yc','Iz_el = I_zc','J_el = J_c','E_el = E_c','G_el = G_c
K_beam.(1; 1) = E_el*A_el/L_el','K_beam.(1; 7) = -E_el*A_el/L_el','K_beam.(7; 1) = -E_el*A_el/L_el','K_beam.(7; 7) = E_el*A_el/L_el
K_beam.(4; 4) = G_el*J_el/L_el','K_beam.(4; 10) = -G_el*J_el/L_el','K_beam.(10; 4) = -G_el*J_el/L_el','K_beam.(10; 10) = G_el*J_el/L_el
K_beam.(3; 3) = 12*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(3; 5) = 6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(3; 9) = -12*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(3; 11) = 6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2
K_beam.(5; 3) = 6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(5; 5) = 4*E_el*Iy_el/L_el','K_beam.(5; 9) = -6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(5; 11) = 2*E_el*Iy_el/L_el
K_beam.(9; 3) = -12*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(9; 5) = -6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(9; 9) = 12*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(9; 11) = -6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2
K_beam.(11; 3) = 6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(11; 5) = 2*E_el*Iy_el/L_el','K_beam.(11; 9) = -6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(11; 11) = 4*E_el*Iy_el/L_el
K_beam.(2; 2) = 12*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(2; 6) = -6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(2; 8) = -12*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(2; 12) = -6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2
K_beam.(6; 2) = -6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(6; 6) = 4*E_el*Iz_el/L_el','K_beam.(6; 8) = 6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(6; 12) = 2*E_el*Iz_el/L_el
K_beam.(8; 2) = -12*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(8; 6) = 6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(8; 8) = 12*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(8; 12) = 6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2
K_beam.(12; 2) = -6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(12; 6) = 2*E_el*Iz_el/L_el','K_beam.(12; 8) = 6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(12; 12) = 4*E_el*Iz_el/L_el
K_col_local = matrix(12; 12)
$Repeat{$Repeat{K_col_local.(i; j) = K_beam.(i; j) @ j = 1 : 12} @ i = 1 : 12}
T_col = matrix(12; 12)
#for ii = 0 : 3
	T_col.(ii*3 + 1; ii*3 + 3) = 1
	T_col.(ii*3 + 2; ii*3 + 1) = 1
	T_col.(ii*3 + 3; ii*3 + 2) = 1
#loop
K_cg = transp(T_col)*K_col_local*T_col
#show
'K columna local (12x12):
K_col_local
'T rotacion columna (vertical):
T_col
'K columna global:
K_cg
#hide
'Viga K local
L_el = d_x
A_el = A_v','Iy_el = I_yv','Iz_el = I_zv','J_el = J_v
K_beam.(1; 1) = E_el*A_el/L_el','K_beam.(1; 7) = -E_el*A_el/L_el','K_beam.(7; 1) = -E_el*A_el/L_el','K_beam.(7; 7) = E_el*A_el/L_el
K_beam.(4; 4) = G_el*J_el/L_el','K_beam.(4; 10) = -G_el*J_el/L_el','K_beam.(10; 4) = -G_el*J_el/L_el','K_beam.(10; 10) = G_el*J_el/L_el
K_beam.(3; 3) = 12*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(3; 5) = 6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(3; 9) = -12*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(3; 11) = 6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2
K_beam.(5; 3) = 6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(5; 5) = 4*E_el*Iy_el/L_el','K_beam.(5; 9) = -6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(5; 11) = 2*E_el*Iy_el/L_el
K_beam.(9; 3) = -12*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(9; 5) = -6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(9; 9) = 12*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(9; 11) = -6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2
K_beam.(11; 3) = 6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(11; 5) = 2*E_el*Iy_el/L_el','K_beam.(11; 9) = -6*E_el*Iy_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(11; 11) = 4*E_el*Iy_el/L_el
K_beam.(2; 2) = 12*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(2; 6) = -6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(2; 8) = -12*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(2; 12) = -6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2
K_beam.(6; 2) = -6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(6; 6) = 4*E_el*Iz_el/L_el','K_beam.(6; 8) = 6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(6; 12) = 2*E_el*Iz_el/L_el
K_beam.(8; 2) = -12*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(8; 6) = 6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(8; 8) = 12*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^3','K_beam.(8; 12) = 6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2
K_beam.(12; 2) = -6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(12; 6) = 2*E_el*Iz_el/L_el','K_beam.(12; 8) = 6*E_el*Iz_el/L_el^2','K_beam.(12; 12) = 4*E_el*Iz_el/L_el
K_vxg = matrix(12; 12)
$Repeat{$Repeat{K_vxg.(i; j) = K_beam.(i; j) @ j = 1 : 12} @ i = 1 : 12}
T_beamY = matrix(12; 12)
#for ii = 0 : 3
	T_beamY.(ii*3 + 1; ii*3 + 2) = 1
	T_beamY.(ii*3 + 2; ii*3 + 1) = -1
	T_beamY.(ii*3 + 3; ii*3 + 3) = 1
#loop
K_vyg = transp(T_beamY)*K_beam*T_beamY
#show
'K viga X global (12x12):
K_vxg
'K viga Y global (12x12):
K_vyg
'<h4>4.2 End offsets — reporte en la cara del soporte (MESHATINTERSECTIONS YES del e2k)</h4>
'<p>ETABS reporta la columna sobre su longitud LIBRE (cara inferior de viga, z=3.5 m), NO sobre el nudo (z=4.0 m).</p>
'<p>El offset es el <b>peralte COMPLETO de viga</b> h_v=0.50 m: CARDINALPT 8 pone el eje de viga en el tope, su cara inferior queda en z=3.5.</p>
'<p>El brazo rigido en K (T_R&rsquo; K T_R) aporta solo ~1% al M2 y mete error en P, asi que se <b>OMITE</b>: el "+15%" del nudo se corrige reportando M en la cara (verificado vs ETABS: +1.1%).</p>
ioff_col = h_v
ioff_beam = 0.20
'<p>Offset columna (peralte viga completo h_v) =</p>
ioff_col
#hide
R_col = matrix(12; 12)
$Repeat{R_col.(i; i) = 1 @ i = 1 : 12}
R_col.(7; 11) = ioff_col
R_col.(8; 10) = -ioff_col
'Offset NO aplicado en K (aporta ~1%, mete error en P) — el match +1.1% sale solo del reporte en cara
K_cg_off = K_cg
#show
'Matriz R (brazo rigido conceptual, NO aplicado en K):
R_col
'K columna ensamblada (sin offset en K):
K_cg_off
'<hr/>
'<h3>PARTE V — Ensamblaje y solucion</h3>
#hide
n_k = 6
K_G = symmetric(n_dof)
F_G = vector(n_dof)
nd_s = vector(4)
#for jj = 0 : n_m - 1
	#for ii = 0 : n_m - 1
		nd_s.1 = n_base + jj*(n_m + 1) + ii + 1
		nd_s.2 = nd_s.1 + 1
		nd_s.3 = nd_s.1 + (n_m + 1) + 1
		nd_s.4 = nd_s.1 + (n_m + 1)
		#for ni = 1 : 4
			#for nj = ni : 4
				j_1 = nd_s.ni
				j_2 = nd_s.nj
				i_1 = n_k*(j_1 - 1) + 1
				i_2 = n_k*(j_2 - 1) + 1
				k_ij = submatrix(K_shell; n_k*(ni - 1) + 1; n_k*ni; n_k*(nj - 1) + 1; n_k*nj)
				#if j_1 > j_2
					add(transp(k_ij); K_G; i_2; i_1)
				#else
					add(k_ij; K_G; i_1; i_2)
				#end if
			#loop
		#loop
	#loop
#loop
col_nI_1 = 1','col_nJ_1 = n_base + 1
col_nI_2 = 2','col_nJ_2 = n_base + n_m + 1
col_nI_3 = 3','col_nJ_3 = n_base + n_m*(n_m + 1) + n_m + 1
col_nI_4 = 4','col_nJ_4 = n_base + n_m*(n_m + 1) + 1
#for ci = 1 : 4
	#if ci ≡ 1
		nI_c = col_nI_1','nJ_c = col_nJ_1
	#else if ci ≡ 2
		nI_c = col_nI_2','nJ_c = col_nJ_2
	#else if ci ≡ 3
		nI_c = col_nI_3','nJ_c = col_nJ_3
	#else
		nI_c = col_nI_4','nJ_c = col_nJ_4
	#end if
	i_1 = n_k*(nI_c - 1) + 1
	i_2 = n_k*(nJ_c - 1) + 1
	add(submatrix(K_cg_off; 1; n_k; 1; n_k); K_G; i_1; i_1)
	add(submatrix(K_cg_off; 1; n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k); K_G; i_1; i_2)
	add(submatrix(K_cg_off; n_k + 1; 2*n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k); K_G; i_2; i_2)
#loop
#for ii = 0 : n_m - 1
	nI_b = n_base + ii + 1','nJ_b = nI_b + 1
	i_1 = n_k*(nI_b - 1) + 1','i_2 = n_k*(nJ_b - 1) + 1
	add(submatrix(K_vxg; 1; n_k; 1; n_k); K_G; i_1; i_1)
	add(submatrix(K_vxg; 1; n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k); K_G; i_1; i_2)
	add(submatrix(K_vxg; n_k + 1; 2*n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k); K_G; i_2; i_2)
#loop
#for jj = 0 : n_m - 1
	nI_b = n_base + n_m + jj*(n_m + 1) + 1','nJ_b = nI_b + (n_m + 1)
	i_1 = n_k*(nI_b - 1) + 1','i_2 = n_k*(nJ_b - 1) + 1
	add(submatrix(K_vyg; 1; n_k; 1; n_k); K_G; i_1; i_1)
	k_ij = submatrix(K_vyg; 1; n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k)
	#if nI_b > nJ_b
		add(transp(k_ij); K_G; i_2; i_1)
	#else
		add(k_ij; K_G; i_1; i_2)
	#end if
	add(submatrix(K_vyg; n_k + 1; 2*n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k); K_G; i_2; i_2)
#loop
#for ii = 0 : n_m - 1
	nI_b = n_base + n_m*(n_m + 1) + ii + 1','nJ_b = nI_b + 1
	i_1 = n_k*(nI_b - 1) + 1','i_2 = n_k*(nJ_b - 1) + 1
	add(submatrix(K_vxg; 1; n_k; 1; n_k); K_G; i_1; i_1)
	add(submatrix(K_vxg; 1; n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k); K_G; i_1; i_2)
	add(submatrix(K_vxg; n_k + 1; 2*n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k); K_G; i_2; i_2)
#loop
#for jj = 0 : n_m - 1
	nI_b = n_base + jj*(n_m + 1) + 1','nJ_b = nI_b + (n_m + 1)
	i_1 = n_k*(nI_b - 1) + 1','i_2 = n_k*(nJ_b - 1) + 1
	add(submatrix(K_vyg; 1; n_k; 1; n_k); K_G; i_1; i_1)
	k_ij = submatrix(K_vyg; 1; n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k)
	#if nI_b > nJ_b
		add(transp(k_ij); K_G; i_2; i_1)
	#else
		add(k_ij; K_G; i_1; i_2)
	#end if
	add(submatrix(K_vyg; n_k + 1; 2*n_k; n_k + 1; 2*n_k); K_G; i_2; i_2)
#loop
'Cargas Live
q_live = 0.5
q_total = q_live*g
#for jj = 0 : n_m
	#for ii = 0 : n_m
		nn = n_base + jj*(n_m + 1) + ii + 1
		#if (ii ≡ 0 ∨ ii ≡ n_m) ∧ (jj ≡ 0 ∨ jj ≡ n_m)
			fac = 0.25
		#else if ii ≡ 0 ∨ ii ≡ n_m ∨ jj ≡ 0 ∨ jj ≡ n_m
			fac = 0.5
		#else
			fac = 1
		#end if
		F_z = -q_total*d_x*d_y*fac
		F_G.((nn - 1)*6 + 3) = F_G.((nn - 1)*6 + 3) + F_z
	#loop
#loop
'BCs pinned
k_s = 10^20
#for nn = 1 : 4
	#for dd = 1 : 3
		dof_fix = (nn - 1)*6 + dd
		K_G.(dof_fix; dof_fix) = K_G.(dof_fix; dof_fix) + k_s
	#loop
#loop
#show
'<h4>5.1 Solucion</h4>
Z = clsolve(K_G; F_G)
'<hr/>
'<h3>PARTE VI — Resultados</h3>
'<h4>6.1 Losa — deflexion w</h4>
#hide
w_max = 0
#for nn = n_base + 1 : n_j
	w_val = Z.((nn - 1)*6 + 3)
	#if abs(w_val) > abs(w_max)
		w_max = w_val
	#end if
#loop
#show
#val
'w_max losa ='w_max*1000'mm
#equ
'<h4>6.2 Columna 1 — fuerzas (sin offset en K, PZENDOFFSETSRIGID No) + reporte en cara z=3.5</h4>
#hide
u_col = vector(12)
#for dd = 1 : 6
	u_col.dd = Z.((col_nI_1 - 1)*6 + dd)
	u_col.(6 + dd) = Z.((col_nJ_1 - 1)*6 + dd)
#loop
u_col_end = u_col
u_col_local = T_col*u_col_end
f_col_local = K_col_local*u_col_local
V_col = abs(f_col_local.2)/g
M_joint = abs(f_col_local.11)/g
M_face = abs(f_col_local.11 - f_col_local.2*ioff_col)/g
#show
#val
'P axial (tonf) ='abs(f_col_local.1)/g
'V shear (tonf) ='V_col
'M2 joint (tonf.m) ='M_joint
'M2 cara (tonf.m) ='M_face
#equ
'<h4>6.3 Tabla comparativa vs ETABS</h4>
#val
'<table border="1" cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
'<tr style="background:#333;color:white"><th>Componente</th><th>Calcpad DKE</th><th>ETABS</th><th>Diff</th></tr>
'<tr><td>P col (tonf)</td><td>'abs(f_col_local.1)/g'</td><td>4.50</td><td>'(abs(f_col_local.1)/g/4.50 - 1)*100'%</td></tr>
'<tr><td>M2 joint (tonf.m)</td><td>'M_joint'</td><td>2.434</td><td>'(M_joint/2.434 - 1)*100'%</td></tr>
'<tr><td><b>M2 cara (tonf.m)</b></td><td><b>'M_face'</b></td><td><b>2.13</b></td><td><b>'(M_face/2.13 - 1)*100'%</b></td></tr>
'<tr><td>w_max (mm)</td><td>'w_max*1000'</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>
'</table>
'<p><b>End offsets:</b> ioff_col = 'ioff_col' m (peralte viga h_v COMPLETO, por CARDINALPT 8), brazo NO aplicado en K (PZENDOFFSETSRIGID No = rigid factor 0), solo reporte en cara. MESHATINTERSECTIONS YES.</p>
'<p><b>Mapeo DKE:</b> bx→-ry, by→rx (T = [1,0,0|0,0,1|0,-1,0])</p>
#equ
'<hr/>
'<h3>PARTE VII — Colormaps losa (w, Mx, My, Mxy, Mmax, Mmin)</h3>
'<h4>7.1 Stress recovery DKE: M = -D * B * Z_e en 4 Gauss + extrapol a nodos</h4>
#hide
'Campos nodales (promediar contribuciones de elementos vecinos)
Mx_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
My_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
Mxy_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
cnt_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
'Campos de corte V13/V23 (equilibrio, por elemento desde sus Gauss propios)
V13_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
V23_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
Vmax_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
cntV_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
maxV13 = 0
maxV23 = 0
'Coeficientes de extrapolacion bilineal Gauss→esquinas
sqr3 = sqrt(3)
#for ej = 0 : n_m - 1
	#for ei = 0 : n_m - 1
		'Nodos del elemento
		nd1 = n_base + ej*(n_m + 1) + ei + 1
		nd2 = nd1 + 1
		nd3 = nd1 + (n_m + 1) + 1
		nd4 = nd1 + (n_m + 1)
		'Extraer Z_e (12 DOFs) con mapeo inverso: shell [uz,rx,ry] → DKE [w,bx,by]
		'T_inv = T^-1 = T^T = [[1,0,0],[0,0,-1],[0,1,0]]
		Z_e = vector(12)
		#for ni = 1 : 4
			#if ni ≡ 1
				nd_i = nd1
			#else if ni ≡ 2
				nd_i = nd2
			#else if ni ≡ 3
				nd_i = nd3
			#else
				nd_i = nd4
			#end if
			Z_e.((ni-1)*3+1) = Z.((nd_i-1)*6+3)
			Z_e.((ni-1)*3+2) = -Z.((nd_i-1)*6+5)
			Z_e.((ni-1)*3+3) = Z.((nd_i-1)*6+4)
		#loop
		'Evaluar M en 4 Gauss points
		#for gc = 1 : 4
			#if gc ≡ 1
				xi_g = gp.1','eta_g = gp.1','x_c = -1','y_c = -1
			#else if gc ≡ 2
				xi_g = gp.2','eta_g = gp.1','x_c = 1','y_c = -1
			#else if gc ≡ 3
				xi_g = gp.1','eta_g = gp.2','x_c = -1','y_c = 1
			#else
				xi_g = gp.2','eta_g = gp.2','x_c = 1','y_c = 1
			#end if
			'B*Z_e en este Gauss point (kappas)
			kx_g = 0','ky_g = 0','kxy_g = 0
			#for jj = 1 : 12
				kx_g = kx_g + dHxdxi(jj; xi_g; eta_g)/a_h*Z_e.jj
				ky_g = ky_g + dHydeta(jj; xi_g; eta_g)/b_h*Z_e.jj
				kxy_g = kxy_g + (dHxdeta(jj; xi_g; eta_g)/b_h + dHydxi(jj; xi_g; eta_g)/a_h)*Z_e.jj
			#loop
			'M = -D * kappa
			Mx_g = -(D_f*kx_g + D_f*nu_c*ky_g)
			My_g = -(D_f*nu_c*kx_g + D_f*ky_g)
			Mxy_g = -(D_f*(1-nu_c)/2*kxy_g)
			'Guardar temporalmente
			#if gc ≡ 1
				Mx_g1 = Mx_g','My_g1 = My_g','Mxy_g1 = Mxy_g
			#else if gc ≡ 2
				Mx_g2 = Mx_g','My_g2 = My_g','Mxy_g2 = Mxy_g
			#else if gc ≡ 3
				Mx_g3 = Mx_g','My_g3 = My_g','Mxy_g3 = Mxy_g
			#else
				Mx_g4 = Mx_g','My_g4 = My_g','Mxy_g4 = Mxy_g
			#end if
		#loop
		'Corte por equilibrio desde los 4 Gauss del PROPIO elemento (sqr3=extrapol natural→fisico; /g=kN→tonf)
		'V13 = -(dMx/dx + dMxy/dy) ; V23 = -(dMy/dy + dMxy/dx)  (signo - = convencion ETABS, confirmado corr=-1.000)
		dMxdx_e = sqr3*((Mx_g2 + Mx_g4) - (Mx_g1 + Mx_g3))/(2*d_x)/g
		dMxydy_e = sqr3*((Mxy_g3 + Mxy_g4) - (Mxy_g1 + Mxy_g2))/(2*d_y)/g
		dMydy_e = sqr3*((My_g3 + My_g4) - (My_g1 + My_g2))/(2*d_y)/g
		dMxydx_e = sqr3*((Mxy_g2 + Mxy_g4) - (Mxy_g1 + Mxy_g3))/(2*d_x)/g
		V13_e = -(dMxdx_e + dMxydy_e)
		V23_e = -(dMydy_e + dMxydx_e)
		'Excluir los 4 elementos ESQUINA (columna = apoyo puntual -> singularidad V~1/r).
		'ETABS acota ahi con la huella 0.4x0.4; su max real (0.793) esta en el campo.
		cX_e = 0
		#if ei ≡ 0
			cX_e = 1
		#end if
		#if ei ≡ n_m - 1
			cX_e = 1
		#end if
		cY_e = 0
		#if ej ≡ 0
			cY_e = 1
		#end if
		#if ej ≡ n_m - 1
			cY_e = 1
		#end if
		#if cX_e*cY_e ≡ 0
			#if abs(V13_e) > maxV13
				maxV13 = abs(V13_e)
			#end if
			#if abs(V23_e) > maxV23
				maxV23 = abs(V23_e)
			#end if
		#end if
		#for cc = 1 : 4
			#if cc ≡ 1
				iiV = ei + 1','jjV = ej + 1
			#else if cc ≡ 2
				iiV = ei + 2','jjV = ej + 1
			#else if cc ≡ 3
				iiV = ei + 2','jjV = ej + 2
			#else
				iiV = ei + 1','jjV = ej + 2
			#end if
			V13_n.(iiV; jjV) = V13_n.(iiV; jjV) + V13_e
			V23_n.(iiV; jjV) = V23_n.(iiV; jjV) + V23_e
			cntV_n.(iiV; jjV) = cntV_n.(iiV; jjV) + 1
		#loop
		'Extrapolar a 4 esquinas
		#for cc = 1 : 4
			#if cc ≡ 1
				x_c = -1','y_c = -1','ni_e = ei + 1','nj_e = ej + 1
			#else if cc ≡ 2
				x_c = 1','y_c = -1','ni_e = ei + 2','nj_e = ej + 1
			#else if cc ≡ 3
				x_c = 1','y_c = 1','ni_e = ei + 2','nj_e = ej + 2
			#else
				x_c = -1','y_c = 1','ni_e = ei + 1','nj_e = ej + 2
			#end if
			Ng1 = (1 + (-1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + (-1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
			Ng2 = (1 + ( 1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + (-1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
			Ng3 = (1 + (-1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + ( 1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
			Ng4 = (1 + ( 1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + ( 1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
			Mx_n.(ni_e; nj_e) = Mx_n.(ni_e; nj_e) + (Ng1*Mx_g1 + Ng2*Mx_g2 + Ng3*Mx_g3 + Ng4*Mx_g4)/g
			My_n.(ni_e; nj_e) = My_n.(ni_e; nj_e) + (Ng1*My_g1 + Ng2*My_g2 + Ng3*My_g3 + Ng4*My_g4)/g
			Mxy_n.(ni_e; nj_e) = Mxy_n.(ni_e; nj_e) + (Ng1*Mxy_g1 + Ng2*Mxy_g2 + Ng3*Mxy_g3 + Ng4*Mxy_g4)/g
			cnt_n.(ni_e; nj_e) = cnt_n.(ni_e; nj_e) + 1
		#loop
	#loop
#loop
'Promediar
#for jj = 1 : n_m + 1
	#for ii = 1 : n_m + 1
		#if cnt_n.(ii; jj) > 0
			Mx_n.(ii; jj) = Mx_n.(ii; jj)/cnt_n.(ii; jj)
			My_n.(ii; jj) = My_n.(ii; jj)/cnt_n.(ii; jj)
			Mxy_n.(ii; jj) = Mxy_n.(ii; jj)/cnt_n.(ii; jj)
		#end if
	#loop
#loop
'V13_n/V23_n ya se acumularon POR ELEMENTO dentro del loop de recovery (desde los Gauss propios). Promediar a nodos:
#for jj = 1 : n_m + 1
	#for ii = 1 : n_m + 1
		#if cntV_n.(ii; jj) > 0
			V13_n.(ii; jj) = V13_n.(ii; jj)/cntV_n.(ii; jj)
			V23_n.(ii; jj) = V23_n.(ii; jj)/cntV_n.(ii; jj)
		#end if
		Vmax_n.(ii; jj) = sqrt(V13_n.(ii; jj)^2 + V23_n.(ii; jj)^2)
	#loop
#loop
'Mmax, Mmin (principals de Mohr)
Mmax_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
Mmin_n = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
#for jj = 1 : n_m + 1
	#for ii = 1 : n_m + 1
		m_avg = (Mx_n.(ii; jj) + My_n.(ii; jj))/2
		m_rad = sqr(((Mx_n.(ii; jj) - My_n.(ii; jj))/2)^2 + Mxy_n.(ii; jj)^2)
		Mmax_n.(ii; jj) = m_avg + m_rad
		Mmin_n.(ii; jj) = m_avg - m_rad
	#loop
#loop
'Deflexion w
w_field = matrix(n_m + 1; n_m + 1)
#for jj = 0 : n_m
	#for ii = 0 : n_m
		nn_g = n_base + jj*(n_m + 1) + ii + 1
		w_field.(ii + 1; jj + 1) = Z.((nn_g - 1)*6 + 3)*1000
	#loop
#loop
'Funciones spline para $Map
w_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; w_field)
Mx_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; Mx_n)
My_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; My_n)
Mxy_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; Mxy_n)
V13_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; V13_n)
V23_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; V23_n)
Vmax_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; Vmax_n)
Mmax_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; Mmax_n)
Mmin_sp(x; y) = spline(1 + x/d_x; 1 + y/d_y; Mmin_n)
PlotWidth = 50*a
PlotHeight = 50*b
PlotStep = 10
#show
'<h4>7.2 Deflexion w (mm)</h4>
$Map{-w_sp(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
#hide
svg_w = PlotWidth + 100
svg_h = PlotHeight + 80
pad_l = 50
pad_b = 40
cw = PlotWidth/n_m
ch = PlotHeight/n_m
#show
#val
'<svg width="'svg_w'" height="'svg_h'" style="position:relative;margin-top:-'svg_h + 20'px;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
#hide
#for jj = 0 : n_m
	#for ii = 0 : n_m
		cx_s = pad_l + ii*cw
		cy_s = pad_b + (n_m - jj)*ch
		val_s = w_field.(ii + 1; jj + 1)
		#show
		#val
		'<circle cx="'cx_s'" cy="'cy_s'" r="6" fill="transparent" stroke="none"><title>w('ii*d_x'; 'jj*d_y') = 'val_s' mm</title></circle>
		#hide
	#loop
#loop
#show
#val
'</svg>
#equ
'<h4>7.3 Momento Mx (tonf.m/m)</h4>
$Map{Mx_sp(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
#val
'<svg width="'svg_w'" height="'svg_h'" style="position:relative;margin-top:-'svg_h + 20'px;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
#hide
#for jj = 0 : n_m
	#for ii = 0 : n_m
		cx_s = pad_l + ii*cw
		cy_s = pad_b + (n_m - jj)*ch
		val_s = Mx_n.(ii + 1; jj + 1)
		#show
		#val
		'<circle cx="'cx_s'" cy="'cy_s'" r="6" fill="transparent" stroke="none"><title>Mx('ii*d_x'; 'jj*d_y') = 'val_s' tonf.m/m</title></circle>
		#hide
	#loop
#loop
#show
#val
'</svg>
#equ
